      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>This would be awesome!&nbsp; I am new to the game - just got the collectors box (kickstarter&nbsp;with all perks) and all of the expansions.<br />We&#39;ve played through about 10 games.&nbsp; Love it!<br /><br />I am a completionist at heart.&nbsp; I&#39;d love to have these two cards, but is there a way for me to see if I already have them?&nbsp; I&#39;d hate to take them from someone else that needs them for their set.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks in advance!!!</p>",
